#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Prijavljen je samo en model obraza. Osvetlitev spremeni videz vašega obraza "
"v kameri, zato lahko en sam model zvečer pod svetilkami (ali podnevi) "
"odpove. Dodajte drugi model, posnet pri drugačni svetlobi, da bo odklepanje "
"zanesljivo kadar koli v dnevu."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Dodajte drugi model"

